---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Valorferrum"
  description="Privacy policy of Valorferrum in accordance with GDPR."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-8 reveal">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="reveal prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h2>1. Data Protection at a Glance</h2>
        <p>This website serves exclusively for information purposes and contains no contextual tracking by third parties. We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel or other tracking tools that transfer personal data to third parties.</p>

        <h2>2. Controller</h2>
        <p>The controller responsible for data processing on this website is:</p>
        <p>[Your Name]<br>Valorferrum<br>[Address]<br>Email: hello@valorferrum.de</p>

        <h2>3. Hosting</h2>
        <p>This website is hosted by OVH. The host stores log files necessary for server security and stability (IP address, timestamp, browser information). Storage is based on Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR.</p>

        <h2>4. Contact Form</h2>
        <p>If you send us inquiries via the contact form, your information from the inquiry form, including the contact details you provide there, will be stored for the purpose of processing the inquiry and in case of follow-up questions. We do not share this data without your consent. Processing is based on Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR.</p>

        <h2>5. Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website uses Umami or Plausible for analytics – both GDPR-compliant, self-hosted solutions without cookies and without data transfer to third parties.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to information, correction, deletion, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. Please contact the address given above.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>